WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.641
Diffusion models made image generation highly
controllable, but video is much harder.

00:00:05.721 --> 00:00:10.554
Video adds a temporal axis: motion patterns vary
enormously across clips,

00:00:10.634 --> 00:00:14.390
and every frame must stay consistent with its neighbours.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:20.784
Reusing the spatial controls designed for images
gives no reliable handle on temporal dynamics,

00:00:20.864 --> 00:00:24.620
so controllable video synthesis stayed an open challenge.
